    </div>
    <div class="grid cols-3">
      <div class="path" data-f="strategy"><div class="ic" style="background:#FBEFD2;">🧠</div><h3>Learn job search strategies</h3><p>Learn proven tactics to navigate a challenging job market, including where to focus your energy, how to network with intention, and how to get in front of decision-makers, so you can land a job faster.</p><div class="path-whisper">This is for you if you've been thinking:<br><span class="pw-q">"I've applied to 100 jobs and heard nothing back"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I don't know how to get noticed anymore"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"My network feels ice cold"</span></div></div>
      <div class="path" data-f="pivot"><div class="ic" style="background:#E3E9FA;">🦋</div><h3>Explore a new career</h3><p>Get clear on what's next, whether that's a new industry, a new function, or a completely different path, and build a realistic plan to make it happen.</p><div class="path-whisper">This is for you if you've been thinking:<br><span class="pw-q">"Am I even in the right field?"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I want to do something that actually fits who I am now"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"Could I really start over at this stage?"</span></div></div>
      <div class="path" data-f="interview negotiate"><div class="ic" style="background:#FDE7D8;">🎤</div><h3>Ace my interview &amp; negotiate my salary</h3><p>Answer tough questions, sharpen your stories, show up confidently in interviews, and walk in ready to close (and get more money, to boot!) with the help of a coach who knows what makes a candidate stand out.</p><div class="path-whisper">This is for you if you've been thinking:<br><span class="pw-q">"I always blank on the tough interview questions"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I don't know how to talk about salary without feeling awkward"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I want to negotiate but I'm scared to push my luck"</span></div></div>
      <div class="path" data-f="feedback"><div class="ic" style="background:#FBEFD2;">📋</div><h3>Get feedback on my resume</h3><p>Already have a resume? Get an expert's read on what's working and what might trap your resume in the ATS black hole, before you hit send.</p><div class="path-whisper">This is for you if you've been thinking:<br><span class="pw-q">"My resume hasn't changed in years"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I don't know if this is even good anymore"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I keep getting rejected before I ever hear from a person"</span></div></div>
      <div class="path" data-f="start"><div class="ic" style="background:#E3E9FA;">🚀</div><h3>Start a side hustle or consulting business</h3><p>Launch your side hustle from scratch, from idea to first customer, guided by an entrepreneur who's built one and knows what it takes.</p><div class="path-whisper">This is for you if you've been thinking:<br><span class="pw-q">"Maybe I'll start a side hustle"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I could sell my services fractionally!"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I think I'm done with traditional employment"</span></div></div>
      <div class="path" data-f="employer"><div class="ic" style="background:#FDE7D8;">🤝</div><h3>Offer coaching to your employees</h3><p>Give your top talent dedicated hours with a coach for leadership growth, career development, or a confidential sounding board. (No extra HR overhead required.)</p><div class="path-whisper">This is for you if you've been thinking:<br><span class="pw-q">"Our top performers are burning out and we don't have support for them"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"We want a real benefit, not another perk nobody uses"</span><br><span class="pw-q">"I wish our managers had someone to talk through hard calls with"</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

