<!-- STORY -->
<section class="section" id="story">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="story-grid">
      <div class="story-photo"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Laura M. Labovich"></div>
      <div class="story-text">
        <div class="eyebrow">The story behind it</div>
        <h2 style="font-size:36px;color:var(--plum);margin:14px 0 20px;line-height:1.2;">Finding a qualified coach isn't hard. Finding the right one is.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:16px;">After 25+ years helping people navigate their careers, I've seen firsthand what happens when a woman gets the right coach at the right moment: the confidence to ask for what she's worth, the clarity to make a bold pivot, the push to finally go after the role she's wanted all along.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:16px;">So I built the marketplace I wished I'd had for my own clients: a curated group of coaches who understand your industry, your stage, and what it's really like to build a career as a woman. Every coach here is vetted against the same high standard, so you can skip the guesswork and get straight to the work that matters. I've spent my career recruiting for major companies, coaching thousands of professionals through career pivots, and building my own business from the ground up, and I built this marketplace to put all of that in your corner.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:16px;">I also know that no single coach can help you get everything you want out of this life. That's why I've always kept a trusted team of coaches around me, people I refer my own clients to whenever they need a different kind of support. I wanted to build something that brings all of that together under one roof, so you're never left wondering where to turn next.</p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:16px;"><strong style="background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 58%,#FBEFAA 58%);color:var(--plum);font-weight:700;">And we stand by our promise with our rematch guarantee: if your first session isn't the right fit, tell us within 48 hours. We'll help you pick a new coach and take 50% off your first session with them. One rematch per client; the credit is good for 90 days.</strong></p>
        <p style="font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;">Helping women accomplish more, and get there faster than they thought possible, is the work of my life. Whatever brought you here today, I'm just glad you came, and I can't wait to see what we accomplish together.</p>
        <div class="story-signature"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Laura M. Labovich signature"></div>
        <div class="story-name">Laura M. Labovich</div>
        <div class="story-title">Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

