<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="section cream" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:860px;">
    <div class="center"><div class="eyebrow">Good to know</div><h2>FAQs</h2></div>
    <div class="faq">
      <details open=""><summary>How are coaches chosen?</summary><p>Every expert goes through our proprietary vetting process, a formula built from years of recruiting and coaching experience that weighs real client outcomes, credentials, and coaching approach, not just a resume. We look for experienced coaches with proven success helping women grow, succeed, and thrive. It's one of the things that sets this marketplace apart: we don't just list coaches, we handpick them.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do sessions work?</summary><p>At the time of purchase, you may choose to have your session via phone call or video call; it's your choice.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How much does it cost?</summary><p>Pricing varies based on coach's experience and expertise.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I know which coach is right for me?</summary><p>Take our 2-minute quiz and we'll match you with coaches suited to your situation, goals, level, and industry. Every coach's profile also shows their specialties, experience, and pricing, so you can review with confidence before you book.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can my employer pay for this?</summary><p>Many clients use their company's professional-development budget or get reimbursed through HR. Upon request, we can provide you with a receipt for services, so your reimbursement is easy. Just <a href="mailto:laura@thecareerstrategygroup.com" style="color:var(--berry);font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;">Contact Us</a> to request this information!</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you offer a guarantee?</summary><p>Yes — our rematch guarantee. If your first session isn't the right fit, tell us within 48 hours. We'll help you pick a new coach and take 50% off your first session with them. One rematch per client; the credit is good for 90 days.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I work with more than one coach, or switch specialties later?</summary><p>Yes. Careers change, and so can your coach. Come back anytime, whether that's in a few weeks or a few years, and we'll match you with the right expert for where you're headed.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

